 "summary": "Of 2,663 TV series in the catalogue, 33% reached a second season, which is used here as the success signal. Renewal is strongest in Teen TV Shows (56%) and TV Sci-Fi & Fantasy (54%) and weakest in Science & Nature TV (14%). An ensemble of three models trained on 2,130 series ranks unseen series with an AUC of 0.7441, and its top 20% of picks contain 39% of all renewals. Under-served genres with strong renewal: Teen TV Shows and TV Sci-Fi & Fantasy. Large share of series sits in low-renewal genres: International TV Shows and Docuseries. Genre profile information drives the predictions most.",
